Public Mozilla root certificates distributed by certifi, copied from the local
Python certifi installation on 2026-09-16. This file contains public trust roots,
not application credentials. See chat-root-ca-LICENSE (Mozilla Public License
2.0) and the source annotations in chat_root_ca.pem.

Upstream: https://github.com/certifi/python-certifi
Update chat_root_ca.pem and rebuild with diagnostics/prepare_chat.py when the
trusted-root policy changes. TLS checks the certificate chain and hostname.
